                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_footnote" : [ {
                  "value" : "<sup>1</sup>. The <i>Explanation</i> omitted by Act 13 of 1975, s. 3 (w.e.f. 25-1-1975).",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_id" : [ {
                  "value" : "31594",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_number" : [ {
                  "value" : "70",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_page_note" : [ {
                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>A person subject to this Act who commits an offence of murder against a person not subject to military, naval or air force law, or of culpable homicide not amounting to murder against such a person or of rape in relation to such a person, shall not be deemed to be guilty of an offence against this Act and shall not be tried by a court-martial, unless he commits any of the said offences--<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (a) while on active service, or<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (b) at any place outside India, or<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (c) at a frontier post specified by the Central Government by notification in this behalf.<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> <sup>1</sup>* <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>* <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>* <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>* <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>*<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
                  "language" : null,
