                "dc.identifier.next_section" : [ {
                  "value" : "81.Limit of punishments under section 80.",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.order_number" : [ {
                  "value" : "80",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.page_from" : [ {
                  "value" : "0",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.page_number" : [ {
                  "value" : "26",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.page_to" : [ {
                  "value" : "0",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.repealed" : [ {
                  "value" : "false",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_footnote" : [ {
                  "value" : "<sup>1</sup>. Subs. by Act 19 of 1955. s. 2 and Sch., for \" the Commander-in-Chief\".<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <sup>2</sup>. Omitted by Act 37 of 1992, s. 4.<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_id" : [ {
                  "value" : "31604",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_number" : [ {
                  "value" : "80",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_page_note" : [ {
                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>Subject to the provisions of section 81, a commanding officer or such other officer as is, with the consent of the Central Government, specified by <sup>1</sup>[the Chief of the Army Staff], may, in the prescribed manner, proceed against a person subject to this Act other wise than as an officer, junior commissioned officer or warrant officer who is charged with an offence under this Act and award such person, to the extent prescribed, one or more of the following punishments, that is to say,--<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (a) imprisonment in military custody up to twenty-eight days;<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (b) detention up to twenty-eight days;<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (c) confinement to the lines up to twenty-eight days;<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (d) extra guards or duties;<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (e) deprivation of a position of the nature of an appointment or of corps or working pay, and in the case of non-commissioned officers, also deprivation of acting rank or reduction to a lower grade of pay;<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (f) forfeiture of good service and good conduct pay;<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (g) severe reprimand or reprimand;<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (h) fine up to fourteen days' pay in any one month;<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (i) penal deductions under clause <i>(g)</i> of section 91;<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> <sup>2</sup>* <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>* <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>* <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>* <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>*<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
